Mock can now build for SUSE Linux Enterprise Server. With `config_opts['suse_subscription_required'] = True`, the repositories are requested from the SUSE Customer Center (or a local RMT/SMT server) at every run. Access comes from the credentials of a host registered with SUSEConnect, or from a registration code set in `config_opts['suse_subscription_regcode']`. See the [SLES chroots](Feature-slechroots) documentation.
